    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "TigerData 发布 pg_textsearch 1.0 BM25 引擎",
      "summary": "PostgreSQL 内置的 ts_rank 缺少逆文档频率与词频饱和，排序质量受限。TigerData 发布的 pg_textsearch 1.0 直接在 PostgreSQL 页面上实现完整 BM25 评分，用 Block-Max WAND 优化 top-k 查询，WAL、复制与 VACUUM 都照常工作。厂商测试称短查询比 ParadeDB 快 2.4 到 6.5 倍，目前不支持短语查询，只有 OR 语义。",
      "url": "https://www.tigerdata.com/blog/pg-textsearch-bm25-full-text-search-postgres",
      "author": "Todd J. Green",
      "source": "TigerData 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-03-31",
      "image": "https://blog-cms.tigerdata.com/blog/content/images/2026/03/pg_textsearch.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "全文检索",
        "扩展",
        "BM25"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Snowflake 撰文讲解 autovacuum 的触发与调优",
      "summary": "MVCC 把删除的行留成死元组，vacuum 既要回收空间，也要冻结旧行避开事务号回卷。文章梳理了 autovacuum 的触发条件：死元组超过阈值 50 加表行数的 0.2 倍，千行表约 250 次更新即触发。作者建议按表把 autovacuum_vacuum_scale_factor 降到 0.1，用 cost_delay 与 cost_limit 控制 I/O 冲击，再用 pg_stat_user_tables 观察死元组。",
      "url": "https://www.snowflake.com/en/blog/engineering/tuning-postgres-vacuum/",
      "author": "Elizabeth Garrett Christensen",
      "source": "Snowflake 工程博客",
      "source_date": "2026-03-31",
      "image": "https://www.snowflake.com/content/dam/snowflake-site/engineering-blog/featured-images/sf-eng-blog-ML-3.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "autovacuum",
        "运维",
        "调优"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "CYBERTEC 演示 Patroni 备库集群的级联复制",
      "summary": "备库集群让整个 Patroni 集群跟随另一个集群：一个节点作 standby leader 从主集群复制，其余节点再从它级联复制，可用于灾备、跨机房迁移与就近只读。Umut TEKIN 给出的关键配置是 standby_cluster 的 host、port 与 primary_slot_name。要注意复制槽不会自动创建，与主集群共用 etcd 时 scope 必须不同，提升前先确认 LSN 追平。",
      "url": "https://www.cybertec-postgresql.com/en/patroni-cascading-replication-with-stanby-cluster/",
      "author": "Umut TEKIN",
      "source": "CYBERTEC",
      "source_date": "2026-03-31",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "Patroni",
        "高可用",
        "复制"
      ],
      "position": 3
